<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#hasMember> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A member participating in this community context or sharing group. When used on a SharingGroup, enumerates the members whose energy flows are accounted within that partition. The reciprocal PECO link from the member to the wrapped peco:Energy_community is peco:is_member_of. Population rule: every member listed under a SharingGroup SHOULD also be listed under the parent CommunityContext via hasMember; no owl:propertyChainAxiom is asserted — implementors must replicate the membership link explicitly."@en .
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#hasMember> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/celine-eu> .
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#hasMember> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has member"@en .
