# https://w3id.org/celine-eu#SpecificPVYield
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#SpecificPVYield> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#SpecificPVYield> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/ObservableProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#SpecificPVYield> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Photovoltaic energy yield normalised by installed peak power, in kWh per kWp, so the figure is independent of plant size — which is the point: the datasets carrying it rank rooftops that do not exist yet. Numerically equal to equivalent full-load hours. Carries no qudt:hasQuantityKind on purpose, and it is the only property here that does not: kWh/kWp is energy over power, so quantitykind:Energy and quantitykind:DimensionlessRatio are both false, and quantitykind:Time, though dimensionally correct, reads as a duration to a consumer who does not already know the identity. A wrong quantity kind silently corrupts unit arithmetic; none corrupts nobody. The unit carries the meaning."@en .
<https://w3id.org/celine-eu#SpecificPVYield> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/celine-eu> .
